  "question": {
    "text": "Suppose the drift velocity <math><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></math> in a material varied with the applied electric field E as <math><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>&#160;</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&#8733;</mo><msqrt><mi>E</mi></msqrt></math>. Then <math><mi>V</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>I</mi></math> graph for a wire made of such a material is best given by:",
